# Generated fixture corpora. The lock file is committed; the payload is not,
# because 10,000 synthetic records would dominate every diff. CI regenerates
# them and verifies against fixtures/*/fixture.lock.json.
fixtures/catalog-240/
fixtures/catalog-1300/
fixtures/catalog-10000/

# Local environment
.env
.env.local
*.local

# Delegation run artifacts: briefs, agent reports, transcripts. Local working
# files with no place in the catalog's history.
.delegate/

# Visual baselines are Linux-only and generated on CI, which is the runner that
# enforces the gate. A local Windows run writes -win32 images; committing them
# would create a second set that drifts from the authoritative one.
*-win32.png
*-darwin.png

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
